(1005, 814, '_feedback_email', 'a:2:{s:2:\"to\";a:1:{i:0;s:40:\"samriddhi <samriddhi@zillioneconomy.com>\";}s:7:\"message\";s:1741:\"\n<!doctype html>\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<body>\n<!-- title -->\n\n\n<!-- response -->\n<p><p><strong>Name:</strong><br /><span>Jonathan Graves</span></p><p><strong>Email:</strong><br /><span>info@prboostcolab.com</span></p><p><strong>Message:</strong><br /><span>Hi,  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nHope this message reaches you well. I think your business needs greater visibility, and I’d be thrilled to help with that.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe’re currently offering a free article on Benzinga, a platform with over 14 million monthly visitors. It’s a great way to build trust and visibility for your company at no cost.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdditionally, for just $279, we can get your business published on major affiliates like FOX, NBC, CBS, ABC, and over 300 other media outlets. The exposure from this could be hugely beneficial for your business.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis offer is only available for the first 10 people who reply, so if you’d like to take advantage of your free feature on Benzinga, simply reply with \"\"YES, I would like to be featured on Benzinga!\"\", and I’ll handle the rest.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExcited about helping your business get the exposure it deserves!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBest regards, <br />\r\nJonathan  <br />\r\nPR Boost<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nShould you wish to stop receiving notifications from this address in the future, please send a reply to this message with the text: “No, I’m not interested”.</span></p></p>\n\n\n<!-- footer -->\n<p><br /><hr /><span style=\"font-size: 12px\">Time: November 6, 2024 at 2:12 am<br />IP Address: 185.88.101.45<br /><br />Source URL: https://zillioneconomy.com/contact/<br /><br />Sent by an unverified visitor to your site.<br /></span><hr /></p>\n</body>\n</html>\n\";}'),
