(1092, 870, '_feedback_email', 'a:2:{s:2:\"to\";a:1:{i:0;s:40:\"samriddhi <samriddhi@zillioneconomy.com>\";}s:7:\"message\";s:1365:\"\n<!doctype html>\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<body>\n<!-- title -->\n\n\n<!-- response -->\n<p><p><strong>Name:</strong><br /><span>Elena Walker</span></p><p><strong>Email:</strong><br /><span>audrey@businesstechgenius.com</span></p><p><strong>Message:</strong><br /><span>Hey<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOverwhelmed by unproductive meetings? Fireflies ai simplifies the process. It effortlessly transforms your meetings into meaningful insights.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCaptures, transcribes, and summarizes your sessions automatically.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKeeps track of every action item.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAllows quick access to any past conversation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStart using Fireflies ai for free and discover how seamless meetings can be.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStart your free trial today at: https://businesstechgenius.com/FirefliesAi <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWarm regards,<br />\r\nEvelyn<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn case you decide not to receive additional notifications from me, simply rebly back to this email with the text: \"No, thank you\"<br />\r\nWiesenstrasse 54, Middletown, NY, USA, 6828</span></p></p>\n\n\n<!-- footer -->\n<p><br /><hr /><span style=\"font-size: 12px\">Time: November 29, 2024 at 1:56 am<br />IP Address: 193.93.193.22<br /><br />Source URL: https://zillioneconomy.com/contact/<br /><br />Sent by an unverified visitor to your site.<br /></span><hr /></p>\n</body>\n</html>\n\";}'),
