(3299, 1632, '_feedback_akismet_values', 'a:30:{s:14:\"comment_author\";s:11:\"Kristi Reed\";s:20:\"comment_author_email\";s:21:\"reedkristim@gmail.com\";s:18:\"comment_author_url\";s:0:\"\";s:20:\"contact_form_subject\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"comment_author_ip\";s:14:\"193.163.92.129\";s:15:\"comment_content\";s:905:\"Hello and good day,\r\n\r\nDid you know there are hundreds of tax credits and incentives available to business and commercial property owners — many of which go unclaimed?\r\n\r\nThe average eligible savings exceeds \\$100,000.\r\n\r\nFor a small monthly subscription (based on your business size), we’ll keep you informed of what you qualify for. There’s no upfront cost — GMG will conduct a complimentary Incentive Analysis. If the analysis reveals meaningful benefit, our procurement fees will apply per project or hourly, as outlined in Circular 230.\r\n\r\nLet’s explore what’s available to you:\r\nhttps://www.kristireedstrydeandgmgadvisor.com\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nKristi Reed \r\nStryde & GMG\r\nSenior Advisor\r\n585-706-7721\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWhen you decide not to receive additional messages from me, just fill the form at bit. ly/fillunsubform with your domain address (URL).\r\nVesterskovvej 25, Granville, CA, USA, 91933\";s:12:\"comment_type\";s:12:\"contact_form\";s:7:\"user_ip\";s:14:\"193.163.92.129\";s:10:\"user_agent\";s:132:\"Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; Intel Mac OS X 12_5) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/114.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 Edg/114.0.1264.71\";s:8:\"referrer\";s:35:\"https://zillioneconomy.com/contact/\";s:4:\"blog\";s:26:\"https://zillioneconomy.com\";s:16:\"comment_date_gmt\";s:25:\"2025-08-13T00:02:38+00:00\";s:11:\"REQUEST_URI\";s:9:\"/contact/\";s:11:\"HTTP_ACCEPT\";s:135:\"text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,image/avif,image/webp,image/apng,*/*;q=0.8,application/signed-exchange;v=b3;q=0.7\";s:20:\"HTTP_ACCEPT_ENCODING\";s:17:\"gzip, deflate, br\";s:20:\"HTTP_ACCEPT_LANGUAGE\";s:14:\"en-US,en;q=0.9\";s:15:\"HTTP_C