 enjoy, I hope you will have some fun.<br>I have had the joy of spending thousands of hours under the sea of economics. I am taking you along to see what I see, and to know what I know.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>     </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>.........................................................................................................................................................................................................................................................................</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>   LEARN MORE:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"start\":1,\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<ul start=\"1\" id=\"block-8f772de6-0900-42de-bec5-106bd8af7cb8\" class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Global economic events that affect the international system.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Technology including the economic impact of new innovation.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Government policy and interventions, government involvement in the economy.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Market structures.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Global economic issues and its impact on India and the world economy.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"70px\",\"right\":\"15px\",\"bottom\":\"70px\",\"left\":\"15px\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#dce0e0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background\" style=\"background-color:#dce0e0;padding-top:70px;padding-right:15px;padding-bottom:70px;padding-left:15px\"><!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"inherit\":true,\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-bloc