cs lens. Hoping to share that lens with you all.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#024a74\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#024a74\">The blogs are an overview of economic concepts , principles &amp; cover a variety of current economic issues &amp; topics related to Indian economy and the world economy. Eliminating all the layers that make economics difficult and boring. The content is super easy and understandable.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#024a74\"}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"color:#024a74\">I choose what I enjoy, I hope you will have some fun.<br>I have had the joy of spending thousands of hours under the sea of economics. I am taking you along to see what I see, and to know what I know.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaId\":154,\"mediaLink\":\"https://zillioneconomy.com/cbsj-thumb/\",\"mediaType\":\"image\",\"mediaSizeSlug\":\"full\",\"imageFill\":true,\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.38,\"y\":0.36},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"2rem\",\"right\":\"2rem\",\"bottom\":\"2rem\",\"left\":\"2rem\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#b0dff8\"}},\"textColor\":\"vivid-red\",\"className\":\"border-radius : 12px;\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide is-stacked-on-mobile is-image-fill border-radius : 12px; has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-background\" style=\"background-color:#b0dff8;padding-top:2rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-bottom:2rem;padding-left:2rem\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\" style=\"background-image:url(https://zillioneconomy.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/cbsj-thumb.jpg);background-position:38% 36%\"><img src=\"https://zilli