 Zillion Economy</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"white\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">COFFEE, ECONOMICS, SLEEP, REPEAT.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"20px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"textColor\":\"black\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#b0dff8\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-black-color has-text-color has-background wp-element-button\" style=\"background-color:#b0dff8\">EXPLORE BLOGS</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"70px\",\"right\":\"15px\",\"bottom\":\"70px\",\"left\":\"15px\"}},\"border\":{\"radius\":\"0px\"},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#ebf7fa\"}},\"layout\":{\"inherit\":false}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background\" style=\"border-radius:0px;background-color:#ebf7fa;padding-top:70px;padding-right:15px;padding-bottom:70px;padding-left:15px\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\"}}},\"layout\":{\"inherit\":true,\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)\"><!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\",\"justifyContent\":\"space-between\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#b0dff8\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"17px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center has-background\" style=\"background-color:#b0dff8;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);font-size:17px\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":55,\"width\":549,\"height\":367,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"37px\"}},\"className\":\"is-style-rounded\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized has-custom-border is-style-rounded\"><img src=\"https://zillioneconomy.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/ameen-fahmy-mXpTl4jNKiA-unsplash-1024x685.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-55\" style=\"border-radius:37px\" width=\"549\" height=\"367\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#b0dff8\"}},\"textColor\":\"vivid-cyan-blue\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-background\" style=\"background-color:#b0dff8;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textTransform\":\"none\",\"fontStyle\":\"italic\",\"fontWeight\":\"900\",\"fontSize\":\"29px\"},\"color\":{\"text\":\"#0066a1\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#0066a1;font-size:29px;font-style:italic;font-weight:900;text-transform:none\"><em>Are you ready to dive &amp; Explore the sea  of Economics?</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#024a74\"}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"color:#024a74\">Hey!!<br>I am Samriddhi Jadhav.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#024a74\"}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"color:#024a74\">At zillion economy , you will see the world through an economics lens. Hoping to share that lens with you all.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#024a74\"}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"color:#024a74\">The blogs are an overview of economic concepts , principles &amp; cover a variety of current economic issues &amp; topics related to Indian economy and the world economy. Eliminating all the layers that make economics difficult and boring. The content is super easy and understandable.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#024a74\"}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"color:#024a74\">I choose what I enjoy, I hope you will have some fun.<br>I have had the joy of spending thousands of hours under the sea of economics. I am taking you along to see what I see, and to know what I know.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaId\":154,\"mediaLink\":\"https://zillioneconomy.com/cbsj-thumb/\",\"mediaType\":\"image\",\"mediaSizeSlug\":\"full\",\"imageFill\":true,\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.38,\"y\":0.36},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"2rem\",\"right\":\"2rem\",\"bottom\":\"2rem\",\"left\":\"2rem\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#b0dff8\"}},\"textColor\":\"vivid-red\",\"className\":\"border-radius : 12px;\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide is-stacked-on-mobile is-image-fill border-radius : 12px; has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-background\" style=\"background-color:#b0dff8;padding-top:2rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-bottom:2rem;padding-left:2rem\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\" style=\"background-image:url(https://zillioneconomy.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/cbsj-thumb.jpg);background-position:38% 36%\"><img src=\"https://zillioneconomy.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/cbsj-thumb.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-154 size-full\"/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontStyle\":\"normal\",\"fontWeight\":\"900\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}},\"color\":{\"text\":\"#0066a1\"}},\"fontSize\":\"regular\"} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color has-regular-font-size\" style=\"color:#0066a1;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);margin-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);margin-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);font-style:normal;font-weight:900\">  <em>LEARN </em>ABOUT</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"start\":1,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#024a74\"}}} -->\n<ul start=\"1\" id=\"block-8f772de6-0900-42de-bec5-106bd8af7cb8\" class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#024a74\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Global economic events that affect the international system.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Technology including the economic impact of new innovation.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Government policy and interventions, government involvement in the economy.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Market structures.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Global economic issues and its impact on India and the world economy.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"70px\",\"right\":\"15px\",\"bottom\":\"70px\",\"left\":\"15px\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#e3f6fe\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background\" style=\"background-color:#e3f6fe;padding-top:70px;padding-right:15px;padding-bottom:70px;padding-left:15px\"><!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"inherit\":true,\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"42px\",\"textTransform\":\"uppercase\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"17px\",\"right\":\"0px\",\"bottom\":\"35px\",\"left\":\"0px\"},\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}},\"textColor\":\"fse-study-lite-BlueGreen\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-fse-study-lite-blue-green-color has-text-color\" style=\"margin-top:17px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:35px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);font-size:42px;text-transfo