e1\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:20px;margin-left:0px;font-size:52px;font-style:normal;font-weight:600\">Explore the Zillion Economy</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"white\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-text-color has-small-font-size\">COFFEE, ECONOMICS, SLEEP, REPEAT.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"20px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"textColor\":\"black\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#b0dff8\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-black-color has-text-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https://zillioneconomy.com/blogs/\" style=\"background-color:#b0dff8\">EXPLORE BLOGS</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"70px\",\"right\":\"15px\",\"bottom\":\"70px\",\"left\":\"15px\"}},\"border\":{\"radius\":\"0px\"},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#f5f8f9\"}},\"layout\":{\"inherit\":false}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background\" style=\"border-radius:0px;background-color:#f5f8f9;padding-top:70px;padding-right:15px;padding-bottom:70px;padding-left:15px\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\"}}},\"layout\":{\"inherit\":true,\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)\"><!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\",\"justifyContent\":\"space-between\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#b0dff8\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"17px\"},\"border\":{\"radius\":\"35px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center has-background\" style=\"border-radius:35px;background-color:#b0dff8;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);font-size:17px\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:gallery {\"linkTo\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":314,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"32px\",\"width\":\"0px\",\"style\":\"none\"}},\"className\":\"is-style-rounded\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border is-style-rounded\"><img src=\"https://zillioneconomy.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Screenshot-2023-09-10-223929-edited.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-314\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:0px;border-radius:32px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"50%\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#b0dff8\"}},\"textColor\":\"vivid-cyan-blue\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-background\" style=\"background-color:#b0dff8;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textTransform\":\"none\",\"fontStyle\":\"italic\",\"fontWeight\":\"900\",\"fontSize\":\"29px\"},\"color\":{\"text\":\"#0066a1\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#0066a1;font-size:29px;font-style:italic;font-weight:900;text-transform:none\"><em>Are you ready to dive &amp; Explore the sea  of Economics?</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#024a74\"}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"color:#024a74\">Hey!!<br>I am Samriddhi Jadhav.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#024a74\"}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"color:#024a74\">At zillion economy , you will see the world through an economics lens. Hoping to share that lens with you all.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#024a74\"}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"color:#024a74\">The blogs are an overview of economic concepts , principles &amp; cover a variety of current economic issues &amp; topics related to Indian economy and the world economy. Eliminating all the layers that make economics difficult and boring. The content is super easy and understandable.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#024a74\"}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"color:#024a74\">I choose what I enjoy, I hope you will have some fun.<br>I have had the joy of spending thousands of hours under the sea of economics. I am taking you along to see what I see, and to know what I know.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:media-text {\"align\":\"wide\",\"mediaId\":430,\"mediaLink\":\"https://zillioneconomy.com/screenshot-2023-09-13-213835/\",\"mediaType\":\"image\",\"mediaWidth\":44,\"mediaSizeSlug\":\"full\",\"imageFill\":false,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"2rem\",\"right\":\"2rem\",\"bottom\":\"2rem\",\"left\":\"2rem\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#b0dff8\"}},\"textColor\":\"vivid-red\",\"className\":\"border-radius : 12px;\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide is-stacked-on-mobile border-radius : 12px; has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-background\" style=\"background-color:#b0dff8;padding-top:2rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-bottom:2rem;padding-left:2rem;grid-template-columns:44% auto\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"https://zillioneconomy.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Screenshot-2023-09-13-213835.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-430 size-full\"/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontStyle\":\"normal\",\"fontWeight\":\"900\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}},\"color\":{\"text\":\"#0066a1\"}},\"fontSize\":\"regular\"} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color has-regular-font-size\" style=\"color:#0066a1;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);margin-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);margin-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);font-style:normal;font-weight:900\">  <em>LEARN </em>ABOUT</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"start\":1,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#024a74\"}}} -->\n<ul start=\"1\" style=\"color:#024a74\" id=\"block-8f772de6-0900-42de-bec5-106bd8af7cb8\" class=\"has-text-color\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Global economic events that affect the international system.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Technology including the economic impact of new innovation.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Government policy and interventions, government involvement in the economy.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Market structures.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Global economic issues and its impact on India and the world economy.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"footer\",\"theme\":\"fse-study-lite\"} /-->', 'Home', 'Displays posts on the homepage, or on the Posts page if a static homepage is set.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '31-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-01-09 14:53:48', '2024-01-09 14:53:48', '', 31, 'https://zillioneconomy.com/?p=442', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(443, 1, '2024-01-10 09:17:50', '2024-01-10 09:17:50', '<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#ffffff\"}}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"7vw\",\"bottom\":\"7vw\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0px\",\"bottom\":\"0px\"}},\"color\":{\"text\":\"#ffffff\"},\"border\":{\"radius\":\"0px\",\"top\":{\"color\":\"var:preset|color|background\",\"width\":\"2px\"},\"right\":[],\"bottom\":[],\"left\":[]}},\"backgroundColor\":\"foreground\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-foreground-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color\" style=\"border-radius:0px;border-top-color:var(--wp--preset--color--background);border-top-width:2px;color:#ffffff;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;padding-top:7vw;padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:7vw;padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\"><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:navigation {\"ref\":217,\"overlayMenu\":\"never\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"14px\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.429\"},\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"8px\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"stretch\"}} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"},\"blockGap\":\"0\"},\"border\":{\"width\":\"0px\",\"style\":\"none\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:0px;padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0\"><!-- wp:social-links {\"customIconColor\":\"#ffffff\",\"iconColorValue\":\"#ffffff\",\"openInNewTab\":true,\"size\":\"has-normal-icon-size\",\"className\":\"is-style-logos-only\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"top\":\"0px\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\"}} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-social-links has-normal-icon-size has-icon-color is-style-logos-only\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><!-- wp:social-link {\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/zillioneconomy/\",\"service\":\"instagram\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:social-link {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/ZillionEconomy\",\"service\":\"twitter\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:social-link {\"url\":\"https://in.pinterest.com/samriddhijadhav_12/\",\"service\":\"pinterest\"} /--></ul>\n<!-- /wp:social-links -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":4,\"className\":\"wp-block-heading\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"19px\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.474\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"16px\",\"right\":\"0px\",\"bottom\":\"0px\",\"left\":\"0px\"}}},\"textColor\":\"background\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left has-background-color has-text-color\" id=\"follow-us\" style=\"margin-top:16px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.474\">Connect With Me </h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4,\"className\":\"wp-block-heading\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"38px\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.474\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0px\",\"right\":\"0px\",\"bottom\":\"0px\",\"left\":\"0px\"},\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0px\",\"bottom\":\"0px\"}}},\"textColor\":\"background\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-background-color has-text-color\" id=\"subscribe-to-newsletter\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-bottom:0px;font-size:38px;line-height:1.474\">ZILLION ECONOMY</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"13px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"font-size:13px\">© Copyright 2024. Powered by WordPress.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'footer', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'footer', '', '', '2024-10-21 14:35:50', '2024-10-21 14:35:50', '', 0, 'https://zillioneconomy.com/2024/01/10/footer/', 0, 'wp_template_part', '', 0),
(445, 1, '2024-01-10 09:26:07', '2024-01-10 09:26:07', '', 'Screenshot 2023-09-11 025200', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'screenshot-2023-09-11-025200-2', '', '', '2024-01-10 09:26:07', '2024-01-10 09:26:07', '', 0, 'https://zillioneconomy.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Screenshot-2023-09-11-025200-edited.png', 0, 'attachment', 'image/png', 0),
(446, 1, '2024-01-10 10:08:04', '2024-01-10 10:08:04', '<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:html -->\nWelcome to my blog! I\'m thrilled that you\'ve taken the time to stop by and get to know me a little better.\r\n\r\nI\'m Samriddhi Jadhav, passionate about economics and the creator behind this blog. I\'ve always had a deep love for economics, and this platform serves as my outlet to share my knowledge, experiences, and thoughts with the world.\r\n\r\nI\'ve always been driven by a curiosity to explore and understand the intricacies of the world around us. I believe that there\'s something truly magical about uncovering new insights, connecting with diverse perspectives, and embracing the constant evolution of knowledge.\r\n\r\nI started this blog as a way to connect with like-minded individuals who share a thirst for knowledge and a desire to grow.\r\n\r\nMy writing style is characterized by a blend of research, personal anecdotes, and a touch of creativity. I strive to make complex concepts accessible, delivering information in a way that is easy to understand and relate to.\r\n\r\nI truly believe that the most enriching experiences come from connections. I like economics and I would like for you to like it too. I invite you to join me on this exciting adventure. Explore the articles, share your thoughts in the comments section, and connect with me on social media. I value your insights, questions, and ideas, and I look forward to engaging in meaningful conversations with each and every one of you.\r\n\r\nLet’s be besties on this journey. Together, let\'s embrace the beauty of knowledge, celebrate our shared interests, and make a positive impact on the world around us.\r\n\r\nWarmest regards,\r\n\r\nSamriddhi Jadhav\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->', 'About Me', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-01-10 10:08:04', '2024-01-10 10:08:04', '', 6, 'https://zillioneconomy.com/?p=446', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
