(930, 0, '2025-01-07 18:09:27', '2025-01-07 18:09:27', 'Ready for a new, green adventure on the water? Our Floating Cruising Island, coming on crowdsourcing platforms this February, is your gateway to emission-free fun. It’s more than just a floating island—it’s a step into the next generation of water recreation, powered by clean, solar energy.\r\n\r\nCheck it out: https://bit.ly/inflatable-island\r\n\r\nHere’s what sets our Inflatable Floating Islands apart: \r\n- Motor-compatible design with a mount for electric motors \r\n- Overhead solar panel charging system for ongoing, clean power \r\n- Built-in canopy for shade and comfort \r\n- Padded seating and accessible cup holders \r\n- Durable, puncture-tough construction \r\n\r\nPicture yourself gliding smoothly across the lake, driven by the sun, with no engine noise and zero emissions. Whether you’re exploring sandbars, seeking that perfect fishing spot, or simply relaxing under the canopy, our Inflatable Floating Islands provide ease, innovation, and a commitment to protecting the planet.\r\n\r\nExcited to experience the next level of water recreation? Visit https://bit.ly/inflatable-island and email us to get notified about our crowdfunding launch this February. Sign up for our mailing list today for exclusive early bird rewards and be among the first to experience this new wave of sustainable water fun!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nShould you don\'t want receiving messages from me in the future, kindly respond to this message with the phrase: “No, I’m not interested”.\n<!--more-->\nAUTHOR: Charlotte Howard\nAUTHOR EMAIL: isln.d.s.a.l.es@gmail.com\nAUTHOR URL: \nSUBJECT: \nIP: 193.233.142.215\nJSON_DATA\n{\"1_Name\":\"Charlotte Howard\",\"2_Email\":\"isln.d.s.a.l.es@gmail.com\",\"3_Message\":\"Ready for a new, green adventure on the water? Our Floating Cruising Island, coming on crowdsourcing platforms this February, is your gateway to emission-free fun. It\\u2019s more than just a floating island\\u2014it\\u2019s a step into the next generation of water recreation, powered by clean, solar energy.\\r\\n\\r\\nCheck it out: https:\\/\\/bit.ly\\/inflatable-island\\r\\n\\r\\nHere\\u2019s what sets our Inflatable Floating Islands apart: \\r\\n- Motor-compatible design with a mount for electric motors \\r\\n- Overhead solar panel charging system for ongoing, clean power \\r\\n- Built-in canopy for shade and comfort \\r\\n- Padded seating and accessible cup holders \\r\\n- Durable, puncture-tough construction \\r\\n\\r\\nPicture yourself gliding smoothly across the lake, driven by the sun, with no engine noise and zero emissions. Whether you\\u2019re exploring sandbars, seeking that perfect fishing spot, or simply relaxing under the canopy, our Inflatable Floating Islands provide ease, innovation, and a commitment to protecting the planet.\\r\\n\\r\\nExcited to experience the next level of water recreation? Visit https:\\/\\/bit.ly\\/inflatable-island and email us to get notified about our crowdfunding launch this February. Sign up for our mailing list today for exclusive early bird rewards and be among the first to experience this new wave of sustainable water fun!\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nShould you don\'t want receiving messages from me in the future, kindly respond to this message with the phrase: \\u201cNo, I\\u2019m not interested\\u201d.\",\"email_marketing_consent\":\"\",\"entry_title\":\"Contact Me\",\"entry_permalink\":\"https:\\/\\/zillioneconomy.com\\/contact\\/\",\"feedback_id\":\"dded28e1f7bff3a8924b8a4d22680d71\"}', 'Charlotte Howard - 2025-01-07 18:09:27', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'dded28e1f7bff3a8924b8a4d22680d71', '', '', '2025-01-07 18:09:27', '2025-01-07 18:09:27', '', 7, 'https://zillioneconomy.com/?post_type=feedback&p=930', 0, 'feedback', '', 0);
