(978, 0, '2025-01-23 21:07:45', '2025-01-23 21:07:45', 'Excited about a exciting, eco-friendly adventure on the water? Our Inflatable Cruising Island, launching on crowdsourcing platforms this February, is your ticket to eco-conscious fun. It’s not just a floating island—it’s a leap into the next generation of water recreation, powered by clean, solar energy.\r\n\r\nCheck it out: https://bit.ly/inflatable-island\r\n\r\nHere’s what sets our Inflatable Floating Islands stand out: \r\n• Motor-ready design with a mount for electric motors \r\n- Overhead solar panel charging system for ongoing, clean power \r\n- Built-in canopy for protection and relaxation \r\n- Padded seating and convenient cup holders \r\n- Durable, puncture-tough construction \r\n\r\nExcited to join the next level of water recreation? Visit https://bit.ly/inflatable-island and send us an email to get notified about our crowdfunding campaign this February. Sign up for our newsletter today for special early bird rewards and be among the first to experience this innovative approach of sustainable water fun!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nShould you wish to stop receiving notifications from this address anymore, kindly reply back to this email with the phrase: \"No, thank you\".\n<!--more-->\nAUTHOR: Richard Jenkins\nAUTHOR EMAIL: i.sln.dsal.e.s@googlemail.com\nAUTHOR URL: \nSUBJECT: \nIP: 193.93.193.59\nJSON_DATA\n{\"1_Name\":\"Richard Jenkins\",\"2_Email\":\"i.sln.dsal.e.s@googlemail.com\",\"3_Message\":\"Excited about a exciting, eco-friendly adventure on the water? Our Inflatable Cruising Island, launching on crowdsourcing platforms this February, is your ticket to eco-conscious fun. It\\u2019s not just a floating island\\u2014it\\u2019s a leap into the next generation of water recreation, powered by clean, solar energy.\\r\\n\\r\\nCheck it out: https:\\/\\/bit.ly\\/inflatable-island\\r\\n\\r\\nHere\\u2019s what sets our Inflatable Floating Islands stand out: \\r\\n\\u2022 Motor-ready design with a mount for electric motors \\r\\n- Overhead solar panel charging system for ongoing, clean power \\r\\n- Built-in canopy for protection and relaxation \\r\\n- Padded seating and convenient cup holders \\r\\n- Durable, puncture-tough construction \\r\\n\\r\\nExcited to join the next level of water recreation? Visit https:\\/\\/bit.ly\\/inflatable-island and send us an email to get notified about our crowdfunding campaign this February. Sign up for our newsletter today for special early bird rewards and be among the first to experience this innovative approach of sustainable water fun!\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nShould you wish to stop receiving notifications from this address anymore, kindly reply back to this email with the phrase: \\\"No, thank you\\\".\",\"email_marketing_consent\":\"\",\"entry_title\":\"Contact Me\",\"entry_permalink\":\"https:\\/\\/zillioneconomy.com\\/contact\\/\",\"feedback_id\":\"35bafd4035741aae1fc7122305184157\"}', 'Richard Jenkins - 2025-01-23 21:07:45', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', '35bafd4035741aae1fc7122305184157', '', '', '2025-01-23 21:07:45', '2025-01-23 21:07:45', '', 7, 'https://zillioneconomy.com/?post_type=feedback&p=978', 0, 'feedback', '', 0),
