(1568, 0, '2025-07-29 16:57:35', '2025-07-29 16:57:35', 'Are you dating someone and would like to know if they could be your best mate who is romantically compatible with you? Can you create a long-lasting romantic relationship, or even a marriage, with them? You can get precise answers to these questions in the ROMANTIC COMPATIBILITY report we can prepare for you and your potential mate. You will also get a RELATIONSHIPS report with more information about your relationship with your potential mate as a FREE bonus. You can order your ROMANTIC COMPATIBILITY report at https://wexxon.com\n<!--more-->\nAUTHOR: Brian WRIGHT Eng.\nAUTHOR EMAIL: newsletter@wexxon.com\nAUTHOR URL: \nSUBJECT: \nIP: 23.105.146.139\nJSON_DATA\n{\"1_Name\":\"Brian WRIGHT Eng.\",\"2_Email\":\"newsletter@wexxon.com\",\"3_Message\":\"Are you dating someone and would like to know if they could be your best mate who is romantically compatible with you? Can you create a long-lasting romantic relationship, or even a marriage, with them? You can get precise answers to these questions in the ROMANTIC COMPATIBILITY report we can prepare for you and your potential mate. You will also get a RELATIONSHIPS report with more information about your relationship with your potential mate as a FREE bonus. You can order your ROMANTIC COMPATIBILITY report at https:\\/\\/wexxon.com\",\"email_marketing_consent\":\"\",\"entry_title\":\"Contact Me\",\"entry_permalink\":\"https:\\/\\/zillioneconomy.com\\/contact\\/\",\"feedback_id\":\"d43e62133efb56c7826debb8056aec3e\"}', 'Brian WRIGHT Eng. - 2025-07-29 16:57:35', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'd43e62133efb56c7826debb8056aec3e', '', '', '2025-07-29 16:57:35', '2025-07-29 16:57:35', '', 7, 'https://zillioneconomy.com/?post_type=feedback&p=1568', 0, 'feedback', '', 0),
(1569, 0, '2025-07-29 19:41:11', '2025-07-29 19:41:11', 'Hi all! My name is Admin Read: \r\n \r\nПовысьте свой уровень шопинга с Kraken - идеальным местом для выгодных покупок и качественных товаров. Если вы ищете модную одежду, лучшую электронику или уникальные подарки, kraken сайт ссылка предлагает вам всё. Не пропустите ежедневные акции и молниеносные распродажи ссылка на сайт кракен, предлагающие сэкономить на любимых товарах. Сделайте свой следующий поход за покупками лёгким благодаря надежному сервису Кракен.\n<!--more-->\nAUTHOR: Roberttit\nAUTHOR EMAIL: ruslanf0zi@gmx.com\nAUTHOR URL: \nSUBJECT: \nIP: 212.34.136.218\nJSON_DATA\n{\"1_Name\":\"Roberttit\",\"2_Email\":\"ruslanf0zi@gmx.com\",\"3_Message\":\"Hi all! My name is Admin Read: \\r\\n \\r\\n\\u041f\\u043e\\u0432\\u044b\\u0441\\u044c\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0441\\u0432\\u043e\\u0439 \\u0443\\u0440\\u043e\\u0432\\u0435\\u043d\\u044c \\u0448\\u043e\\u043f\\u0438\\u043d\\u0433\\u0430 \\u0441 Kraken - \\u0438\\u0434\\u0435\\u0430\\u043b\\u044c\\u043d\\u044b\\u043c \\u043c\\u0435\\u0441\\u0442\\u043e\\u043c \\u0434\\u043b\\u044f \\u0432\\u044b\\u0433\\u043e\\u0434\\u043d\\u044b\\u0445 \\u043f\\u043e\\u043a\\u0443\\u043f\\u043e\\u043a \\u0438 \\u043a\\u0430\\u0447\\u0435\\u0441\\u0442\\u0432\\u0435\\u043d\\u043d\\u044b\\u0445 \\u0442\\u043e\\u0432\\u0430\\u0440\\u043e\\u0432. \\u0415\\u0441\\u043b\\u0438 \\u0432\\u044b \\u0438\\u0449\\u0435\\u0442\\u0435 \\u043c\\u043e\\u0434\\u043d\\u0443\\u044e \\u043e\\u0434\\u0435\\u0436\\u0434\\u0443, \\u043b\\u0443\\u0447\\u0448\\u0443\\u044e \\u044d\\u043b\\u0435\\u043a\\u0442\\u0440\\u043e\\u043d\\u0438\\u043a\\u0443 \\u0438\\u043b\\u0438 \\u0443\\u043d\\u0438\\u043a\\u0430\\u043b\\u044c\\u043d\\u044b\\u0435 \\u043f\\u043e\\u0434\\u0430\\u0440\\u043a\\u0438, kraken \\u0441\\u0430\\u0439\\u0442 \\u0441\\u0441\\u044b\\u043b\\u043a\\u0430 \\u043f\\u0440\\u0435\\u0434\\u043b\\u0430\\u0433\\u0430\\u0435\\u0442 \\u0432\\u0430\\u043c \\u0432\\u0441\\u0451. \\u041d\\u0435 \\u043f\\u