(1632, 0, '2025-08-13 00:02:38', '2025-08-13 00:02:38', 'Hello and good day,\r\n\r\nDid you know there are hundreds of tax credits and incentives available to business and commercial property owners — many of which go unclaimed?\r\n\r\nThe average eligible savings exceeds \\$100,000.\r\n\r\nFor a small monthly subscription (based on your business size), we’ll keep you informed of what you qualify for. There’s no upfront cost — GMG will conduct a complimentary Incentive Analysis. If the analysis reveals meaningful benefit, our procurement fees will apply per project or hourly, as outlined in Circular 230.\r\n\r\nLet’s explore what’s available to you:\r\nhttps://www.kristireedstrydeandgmgadvisor.com\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nKristi Reed \r\nStryde &amp; GMG\r\nSenior Advisor\r\n585-706-7721\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWhen you decide not to receive additional messages from me, just fill the form at bit. ly/fillunsubform with your domain address (URL).\r\nVesterskovvej 25, Granville, CA, USA, 91933\n<!--more-->\nAUTHOR: Kristi Reed\nAUTHOR EMAIL: reedkristim@gmail.com\nAUTHOR URL: \nSUBJECT: \nIP: 193.163.92.129\nJSON_DATA\n{\"1_Name\":\"Kristi Reed\",\"2_Email\":\"reedkristim@gmail.com\",\"3_Message\":\"Hello and good day,\\r\\n\\r\\nDid you know there are hundreds of tax credits and incentives available to business and commercial property owners \\u2014 many of which go unclaimed?\\r\\n\\r\\nThe average eligible savings exceeds \\\\$100,000.\\r\\n\\r\\nFor a small monthly subscription (based on your business size), we\\u2019ll keep you informed of what you qualify for. There\\u2019s no upfront cost \\u2014 GMG will conduct a complimentary Incentive Analysis. If the analysis reveals meaningful benefit, our procurement fees will apply per project or hourly, as outlined in Circular 230.\\r\\n\\r\\nLet\\u2019s explore what\\u2019s available to you:\\r\\nhttps:\\/\\/www.kristireedstrydeandgmgadvisor.com\\r\\n\\r\\nBest regards,\\r\\nKristi Reed \\r\\nStryde &amp; GMG\\r\\nSenior Advisor\\r\\n585-706-7721\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nWhen you decide not to receive additional messages from me, just fill the form at bit. ly\\/fillunsubform with your domain address (URL).\\r\\nVesterskovvej 25, Granville, CA, USA, 91933\",\"email_marketing_consent\":\"\",\"entry_title\":\"Contact Me\",\"entry_permalink\":\"https:\\/\\/zillioneconomy.com\\/contact\\/\",\"feedback_id\":\"d953f89e759473c57ead6fa37e65c448\"}', 'Kristi Reed - 2025-08-13 00:02:38', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'd953f89e759473c57ead6fa37e65c448', '', '', '2025-08-13 00:02:38', '2025-08-13 00:02:38', '', 7, 'https://zillioneconomy.com/?post_type=feedback&p=1632', 0, 'feedback', '', 0),
(1633, 0, '2025-08-13 00:11:25', '2025-08-13 00:11:25', 'Hi,\r\n\r\nI wanted to see if you\'d be interested in a link exchange for mutual SEO benefits. I can link to your site (zillioneconomy.com) from a few of our high-authority websites. In return, you would link back to our clients’ sites, which cover niches like health, business services, real estate, consumer electronics, and more.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re interested, let me know — I\'d be happy to share more details!\r\n\r\nThanks for your time,\r\nKaren\r\nSEO Account Manager\n<!--more-->\nAUTHOR: Karen B.\nAUTHOR EMAIL: outreachseo56@gmail.com\nAUTHOR URL: \nSUBJECT: \nIP: 208.52.181.96\nJSON_DATA\n{\"1_Name\":\"Karen B.\",\"2_Email\":\"outreachseo56@gmail.com\",\"3_Message\":\"Hi,\\r\\n\\r\\nI wanted to see if you\'d be interested in a link exchange for mutual SEO benefits. I can link to your site (zillioneconomy.com) from a few of our high-authority websites. In return, you would link back to our clients\\u2019 sites, which cover niches like health, business services, real estate, consumer electronics, and more.\\r\\n\\r\\nIf you\'re interested, let me know \\u2014 I\'d be happy to share more details!\\r\\n\\r\\nThanks for your time,\\r\\nKaren\\r\\nSEO Account Manager\",\"email_marketing_consent\":\"\",\"entry_title\":\"Contact Me\",\"entry_permalink\":\"https:\\/\\/zillioneconomy.com\\/contact\\/\",\"feedback_id\":\"c8ffb0395b6e89b67c864bbf1bee1148\"}', 'Karen B. - 2025-08-13 00:11:25', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'c8ffb0395b6e89b67c864bbf1bee1148', '', '', '2025-08-13 00:11:25', '2025-08-13 00:11:25', '', 7, 'https://zillioneconomy.com/?post_type=feedback&p=1633', 0, 'feedback', '', 0),
